-- Regression: inside an outer map, binding a computed reduction result (`offset`)
-- and capturing it in an inner map over a scan previously made SSA lowering report
-- "cyclic source evaluation during SSA emission". The updated compiler now passes
-- compilation and GPU output checks on both WGSL and SPIR-V (2026-10-27).
-- Expected: compile successfully; [[1,2],[3,4]] should produce [[5,7],[11,15]].
-- Control: compute the reduction + 1 inside the inner map instead of binding offset.
entry main(xs: [2][2]i32) [2][2]i32 =
  map(|row|
    let offset = reduce((+), 0i32, row) + 1 in
    map(|x| x + offset, scan((+), 0i32, row)), xs)
